  "riskDisclosure": {
    "title": "Risk Disclosure Statement",
    "cancel": "Cancel",
    "confirm": "Confirm",
    "content": {
      "paragraph1": "1. When trading futures, if market movements are unfavorable and cause losses that deplete your position margin, this exchange will liquidate your positions according to system rules and disclose liquidation details. Please take note.",
      "paragraph2": "2. You must carefully read and adhere to this exchange's business rules. Understand the futures mechanism and principles, be aware of various market risks, and allocate funds appropriately for trading.",
      "paragraph3": "3. In certain extreme market conditions, you may find it difficult or impossible to close your open positions. For example, if your profit ranks first in effective leveraged PnL across the entire futures market and the insurance fund is insufficient to cover the losses from auto-deleveraging.",
      "paragraph4": "4. Due to changes in local laws, regulations, policies, modifications to exchange rules, or the implementation of emergency measures, this exchange will issue advance notices. Your open positions may need to be closed, but remaining position margin and profits will still be settled by the platform!",
      "paragraph5": "5. For reasons beyond this exchange's control, such as force majeure events (e.g., earthquakes, floods, fires) or failures in computer/communication systems, your orders may not be filled or fully filled, and you may bear resulting losses.",
      "paragraph6": "6. \"Hedging\" transactions, like speculative trades, also face risks from price fluctuations. Please understand the related mechanisms beforehand.",
      "paragraph7": "7. If your account is operated by someone else, it may compromise the security of your futures margin. Please ensure your account security personally."
    }
  },
